{"ID":"20240205165626-99igur7","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205165626-99igur7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165626-99igur7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618162946-803u0by\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607110944-khgooq1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618163030-5fialcw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"042石斛","type":"doc","updated":"20240805115318"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240618162946-803u0by","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618162946-803u0by","updated":"20240618162950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"铁皮石斛"}]},{"ID":"20240206105538-i084h70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105538-i084h70","updated":"20240206105550"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于广西、云南、浙江、贵州等地。\n【性状】\t金钗石斛：茎中、下部扁圆柱形，向上稍“之”字形弯曲，长1842cm，中部直径0.41cm，节间长1.56cm。表面金黄色或绿黄色，有光泽，具深纵沟及纵纹，节稍膨大，棕色，常残留灰褐色叶鞘。质轻而脆，断面较疏松。气微，味苦。铁皮石斛：茎细长圆柱形，常弯曲，盘绕成团或捆成把，长1140cm，直径13mm，节间长0.42.3cm。表面金黄色，有光泽，具细纵纹。质柔韧而实，断面较平坦。叶鞘常短于节间，留有环状间隙，味淡或微苦。\n马鞭石斛：茎细长圆锥形，上部有少数分枝，长30150cm，直径28mm，节间长24.5cm。表面棕黄色，有89条纵沟。质疏松，断面纤维性。气微，味微苦。商品常切成1.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3cm长段，切面灰白色。\n【性味】\t甘，微寒。\n【功效】\t养阴清热，益胃生津。用于热伤津液，低热烦渴，舌红少苔；胃阴不足，口渴咽干，呕逆少食，胃脘隐痛，舌光少苔；肾阴不足，视物昏花。\n【注解】\t“铁皮枫斗”：指铁皮石斛减去部分须根后，边炒边扭成螺旋形或弹簧状，烘干，习称“铁皮枫斗”。\n【附注】\t1. 金钗石斛 (Dendrobium nobile) 已被列入《濒危野生动植物种国际贸易公约》 (CITES) 附录二中。该物种虽可进行贸易，但须受许可证制度管制。\n2. 铁皮石斛 (Dendrobium officinale) 在《世界自然保护联盟濒危物种红色名录》被列为极危物种。另外，它已被列入《濒危野生动植物种国际贸易公约》 (CITES) 附录二中。该物种虽可进行贸易，但须受许可证制度管制。\n3. 马鞭石斛 (Dendrobium fimbriatum"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"\u003e"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"/i"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"\u003e"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":") 已被列入《濒危野生动植物种国际贸易公约》 (CITES) 附录二中。该物种虽可进行贸易，但须受许可证制度管制。"}]},{"ID":"20240206105539-bg2gf3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105539-bg2gf3z","updated":"20240206105539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206105539-82ymkf2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165945-vs1b3jw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165945-vs1b3jw","updated":"20240205165945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"石斛"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/石斛-20240205165945-f1q9741.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240618163351-9kkj7bp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618163351-9kkj7bp","updated":"20240805104846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240805105607-n5waa66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805105607-n5waa66","updated":"20240805105607"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 432px;","style":"width: 422px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240618163351-msxk16t.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 422px;\" parent-style=\"width: 432px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":